From: lienminhld49 <net269g022@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:39:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Custom qbittorrent-nox build for Windows + full peer ID in
 WebAPI

- sync/torrentPeers: add `peer_id` (hex, 40 chars) and `peer_id_b64`
  (Base64 of the 20-byte peer ID); empty when not known yet
- PeerInfo::peerId(): expose the raw 20-byte peer ID
- Windows: build qbittorrent-nox (GUI=OFF) as a console executable
- Add GitHub Actions workflow to build qbittorrent-nox for Windows x64
  (runs on push to icafe-* branches or manually)
- Add run-nox.bat helper

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014JtEU7uM8R25hoKSw7wJ6B
